linux-trackpad-driver (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Wake promptly on trackpad hotplug and retry missing or dead sessions.
  * Preserve native Bluetooth input and release grabs on output failure.
  * Complete debounced releases during idle and improve build diagnostics.
  * Include Fedora RPM packaging and Debian configuration installation fixes.

 -- Aarón Roque Fonseca <aaronroquefonseca@gmail.com>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

linux-trackpad-driver (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging: ltd binary, udev rules, systemd units
    (main, reconnect@, resume, system-sleep hook), default system config.
    Units ship disabled; postinst reloads daemon/udev only.

 -- Aarón Roque Fonseca <aaronroquefonseca@gmail.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
